    "prefix": "#"
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": "Welcome to your LN journey with SDK."
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": "In this course, you will learn the basics of the Rust book, then follow up with some LN programming using SDKs, and finish with some practical exercises. Our teachers from various backgrounds will guide you toward practical skills and explain the various challenges that today's LN engineers often face."
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": "This course was filmed during a LIVE seminar organized by Fulgur'Ventures during the LN Tuscany event in October 2023."
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": "Enjoy the course!"
  },
