    "prefix": "###"
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": "Welcome to this advanced programming course on SDKs. In this training, you will learn the basics of Rust, then focus on BTC & Rust, and finish with some practical exercises using SDKs."
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": "This training will be available only in English for now and was part of a live seminar organized last October in Tuscany by Fulgure Venture. The program of the LIVE event can be found below, and this training will focus on the first week only. The second half was targeted at RGB and can be found in the RGB course."
